@startuml Activity_Diagram_UC06
title Activity Diagram: UC-06 Manage Reports

|Staff/Admin|
start
:Log in and navigate to Sales Reports Page from Admin Panel Dashboard;
|System|
:Authenticate access rights to reporting features;
if (Access authorized?) then (Yes)
  |Staff/Admin|
  :Select report type and date range or filters;
  |System|
  :Compile and aggregate order, payment, and inquiry data;
  if (Data available for selected criteria?) then (Yes)
    :Generate analytics dashboard with charts and summary figures;
    :Display statistics and trends on the Sales Reports Page;
    |Staff/Admin|
    :Review performance metrics and sales insights;
    if (Order volume exceeds normal threshold?) then (Yes)
      |System|
      :Flag and alert Staff/Admin about high-demand period;
    else (No)
      :Continue monitoring as normal;
    endif
    if (Admin wants to export or print the report?) then (Yes)
      :Select Export or Print;
      |System|
      :Compile report into downloadable file or print-ready format;
      :Provide file for download or send to printer;
    else (No)
      :Finish review without exporting;
    endif
  else (No)
    |System|
    :Display "No data available" message;
  endif
else (No)
  |System|
  :Display permissions error and deny access;
endif

stop
@enduml
